<title>THAILAND: BEC World third quarter net profit up.</title>
<headline>BEC World third quarter net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.22		     12.13</p>
<p>    Net			444.04		     77.08</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 6.71     vs	    67.81</p>
<p>    Net		    1,269.83     vs	   167.67</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is BEC World Plc. The company just began to consolidate earnings from some subsidiaries this year. Earnings per share were lower than same period year ago because company publicly floated new shares.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
